        "@value": "Chamber Pints: David Marks & Max Cardilli | Chamberfest"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Chamber Pints: David Marks & Max Cardilli | Classically trained, folk-roots inspired duo David Marks & Max Cardilli will be joining us at Kaffé 1870 — after packing the house in our January show. A violist, guitarist, and singer-songwriter, David Marks has teamed up with his NACO colleague, bassist extraordinaire Max Cardilli, to create a genre-bending string duo. This evening concert will be a delightful exploration of traditional Appalachian and bluegrass music, as well as classical forms and medieval ballads."
      }
    ],
