        "@language": "fr-fr",
        "@value": "Chamber Chats: Conversations with Julie Nesrallah"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr-fr",
        "@value": "Our January Chamber Chat features Ottawa's own Julie Nesrallah, mezzo-soprano and host of CBC's Tempo. Julie Nesrallah is a singer, actress and broadcaster who dazzles audiences with her engaging personality and her rich, expressive voice.. Chamber Chats: Conversations feature in-depth conversations led by Chamberfest Artistic Director, Carissa Klopoushak."
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#url": [
