  {
    "@id": "https://www.chamberfest.com/event/2023/gabriela-montero-piano-and-quatuor-calidore-string-quartet/",
    "http://ogp.me/ns#locale": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "en_US"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#type": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "article"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#title": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Gabriela Montero & Calidore Quartet"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Beloved Venezuelan pianist and composer Gabriela Montero returns to Chamberfest with the world premiere of her new Piano Quintet. She is joined by her friends, the Calidore String Quartet, in a program made complete with a Mozart “Haydn” quartet and Shostakovich’s grandiose Piano Quintet.Montero’s visionary interpretations and unique compositional gifts have garnered her critical acclaim and a devoted following on the world stage. Anthony Tommasini remarked in The New York Times that “Montero’s playing had everything: crackling rhythmic brio, subtle shadings, steely power…soulful lyricism…unsentimental expressivity.”The Calidore String Quartet are renowned for their “deep reserves of virtuosity and irrepressible dramatic instinct” (New York Times). Their unique “balance of intellect and expression” (Los Angeles Times) is complemented by the feeling that “four more individual musicians are unimaginable, yet these speak, breathe, think and feel as one” (Washington Post). The commission of Gabriela Montero’s Piano Quintet is generously supported by Millie Mirsky."
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#url": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "https://www.chamberfest.com/event/2023/gabriela-montero-piano-and-quatuor-calidore-string-quartet/"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#site_name": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Chamberfest"
      }
    ],
